{"logId": "c51c31bc-d2fd-4834-bb34-aabdb9ff75e7", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "时送货安装到位：“48”的意思就是，凡县区顾客在胖东来购买家电的，要求48小时送货安装到位：“100”则是说，如果在规定时间内送不到货，一次赔付顾客送货延误费100元钱；之后每延误一天，则在100元钱的基础上递增30元。", "block_bbox": [238, 228, 1015, 325], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 228.0], [1015.0, 228.0], [1015.0, 325.0], [238.0, 325.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "免费维修，真情待客的服务同样在胖东来百货一楼鞋部员工中间流传着……今年7月13日，一名陈姓大妈在我市其他商场买了一双鞋。此后不久，陈大妈发现鞋子上2根交叉的带子被宠物狗咬断了。由于还没出“三包”期，陈大妈就拿着鞋子去那家商场维修，可商场的服务员表示，鞋子属于人为破坏的，不在“三包”范围之列，他们不管维修。", "block_bbox": [239, 333, 1017, 465], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 333.0], [1017.0, 333.0], [1017.0, 465.0], [239.0, 465.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "后来，听说胖东来百货可以免费修鞋，老人就拿着那双被狗咬坏的鞋子来到商场。由于破损处刚好在鞋面，二次维修肯定会影响到鞋子的美观，胖东来百货鞋部刚好有同样款式的鞋子，所以商场的服务人员决定，把鞋子送到厂家给老人维修。很快，鞋子修好了，换了鞋面的鞋子跟新的一样。按照规定，返厂维修的鞋子需由厂方和商场各支付一半费用，可胖东来百货却没有收取老人一分钱，自掏腰包给老人修好了鞋。", "block_bbox": [239, 473, 1016, 639], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 473.0], [1016.0, 473.0], [1016.0, 639.0], [239.0, 639.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "不是在胖东来百货买的商品，人家尚且服务得这么贴心、周到、细致，而且不计较成本，要是在这里买的商品呢？售后服务肯定更差不了！陈大妈这样在心里盘算了一下，就顺理成章地成为了胖东来百货的忠实客户。她说，俺到胖东来百货买东西，觉得放心。", "block_bbox": [237, 647, 1016, 709], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 647.0], [1016.0, 647.0], [1016.0, 709.0], [237.0, 709.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [695, 717, 1015, 813], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[695.0, 717.0], [1015.0, 717.0], [1015.0, 813.0], [695.0, 813.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [242, 731, 686, 1065], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[242.0, 731.0], [686.0, 731.0], [686.0, 1065.0], [242.0, 1065.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一楼鞋区课长助理马游彬说，现在，他们平均每天都要收200多双需要修理的鞋子，其中不是在他们商场购买的鞋子要占一多半。这么大的工作量需要3名维修工全天不停地修鞋，而每双鞋最长的维修周期不得超过一周。", "block_bbox": [698, 820, 1015, 1057], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[698.0, 820.0], [1015.0, 820.0], [1015.0, 1057.0], [698.0, 1057.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "这么少的人手，这么大的工作", "block_bbox": [738, 1065, 1014, 1091], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[738.0, 1065.0], [1014.0, 1065.0], [1014.0, 1091.0], [738.0, 1091.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "量，他们苦吗？他们累吗？鞋类维修工小赵淡淡一笑，这样对记者说，苦，但苦中有甜：累，但累得舒心。", "block_bbox": [240, 1100, 1008, 1161], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 1100.0], [1008.0, 1100.0], [1008.0, 1161.0], [240.0, 1161.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "所有的免费项目，无疑会增加胖东来的经营成本，其投入的财力也是庞大的，但得益的是新乡的消费者，胖东来就认为值得，并且一再表示，还要加大投入，争取做得更好，", "block_bbox": [238, 1170, 1015, 1232], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1170.0], [1015.0, 1170.0], [1015.0, 1232.0], [238.0, 1232.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9390270113945007, "coordinate": [238, 228, 1015, 325], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 228.0], [1015.0, 228.0], [1015.0, 325.0], [238.0, 325.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9502885937690735, "coordinate": [239, 333, 1017, 465], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 333.0], [1017.0, 333.0], [1017.0, 465.0], [239.0, 465.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9538152813911438, "coordinate": [239, 473, 1016, 639], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 473.0], [1016.0, 473.0], [1016.0, 639.0], [239.0, 639.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9148437976837158, "coordinate": [237, 647, 1016, 709], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[237.0, 647.0], [1016.0, 647.0], [1016.0, 709.0], [237.0, 709.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9626302123069763, "coordinate": [242, 731, 686, 1065], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[242.0, 731.0], [686.0, 731.0], [686.0, 1065.0], [242.0, 1065.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9175907373428345, "coordinate": [695, 717, 1015, 813], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[695.0, 717.0], [1015.0, 717.0], [1015.0, 813.0], [695.0, 813.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9460336565971375, "coordinate": [698, 820, 1015, 1057], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[698.0, 820.0], [1015.0, 820.0], [1015.0, 1057.0], [698.0, 1057.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7528635859489441, "coordinate": [738, 1065, 1014, 1091], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[738.0, 1065.0], [1014.0, 1065.0], [1014.0, 1091.0], [738.0, 1091.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.873462975025177, "coordinate": [240, 1100, 1008, 1161], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[240.0, 1100.0], [1008.0, 1100.0], [1008.0, 1161.0], [240.0, 1161.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9122681021690369, "coordinate": [238, 1170, 1015, 1232], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 1170.0], [1015.0, 1170.0], [1015.0, 1232.0], [238.0, 1232.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "时送货安装到位：“48”的意思就是，凡县区顾客在胖东来购买家电的，要求48小时送货安装到位：“100”则是说，如果在规定时间内送不到货，一次赔付顾客送货延误费100元钱；之后每延误一天，则在100元钱的基础上递增30元。\n\n免费维修，真情待客的服务同样在胖东来百货一楼鞋部员工中间流传着……今年7月13日，一名陈姓大妈在我市其他商场买了一双鞋。此后不久，陈大妈发现鞋子上2根交叉的带子被宠物狗咬断了。由于还没出“三包”期，陈大妈就拿着鞋子去那家商场维修，可商场的服务员表示，鞋子属于人为破坏的，不在“三包”范围之列，他们不管维修。\n\n后来，听说胖东来百货可以免费修鞋，老人就拿着那双被狗咬坏的鞋子来到商场。由于破损处刚好在鞋面，二次维修肯定会影响到鞋子的美观，胖东来百货鞋部刚好有同样款式的鞋子，所以商场的服务人员决定，把鞋子送到厂家给老人维修。很快，鞋子修好了，换了鞋面的鞋子跟新的一样。按照规定，返厂维修的鞋子需由厂方和商场各支付一半费用，可胖东来百货却没有收取老人一分钱，自掏腰包给老人修好了鞋。\n\n不是在胖东来百货买的商品，人家尚且服务得这么贴心、周到、细致，而且不计较成本，要是在这里买的商品呢？售后服务肯定更差不了！陈大妈这样在心里盘算了一下，就顺理成章地成为了胖东来百货的忠实客户。她说，俺到胖东来百货买东西，觉得放心。\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_242_731_686_1065.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"37%\" /></div>\n\n\n一楼鞋区课长助理马游彬说，现在，他们平均每天都要收200多双需要修理的鞋子，其中不是在他们商场购买的鞋子要占一多半。这么大的工作量需要3名维修工全天不停地修鞋，而每双鞋最长的维修周期不得超过一周。\n\n这么少的人手，这么大的工作\n\n量，他们苦吗？他们累吗？鞋类维修工小赵淡淡一笑，这样对记者说，苦，但苦中有甜：累，但累得舒心。\n\n所有的免费项目，无疑会增加胖东来的经营成本，其投入的财力也是庞大的，但得益的是新乡的消费者，胖东来就认为值得，并且一再表示，还要加大投入，争取做得更好，", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_242_731_686_1065.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c51c31bc-d2fd-4834-bb34-aabdb9ff75e7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_242_731_686_1065.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A22Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb1d2cd56aa456cdc29669fc6c1d6ca36dfe4da4cc8a3916e00ac688ffedd89b7"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c51c31bc-d2fd-4834-bb34-aabdb9ff75e7/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A23Z%2F-1%2F%2F573227351a5ffe898ca85f47e70674664a070de7d6761846b8b3881c742208f4"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c51c31bc-d2fd-4834-bb34-aabdb9ff75e7/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A23Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc70e389975ee25c771e747ac2a5831612ff9b0df8940f87387c634d162263d40"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//c51c31bc-d2fd-4834-bb34-aabdb9ff75e7/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A04%3A23Z%2F-1%2F%2Ffb2c9ad5f4410c326b880de1aa29b93fad43e44188b7bd534d7b653cdee99af0"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
